---------------------------------

All rights reserved. No use, copying, modification, or distribution of any
part of this code is permitted while this repository is private, except by
the author (Alexey Legoshin, GitHub: alexlegoshin) or by a Claude Code
session operating under the author's direct control.

This software was never deployed or used in real trading during the
"Tinkoff" era of this broker (i.e. before its rebrand to T-Bank). Any use of
the ideas or code in this repository, at any time, must strictly follow
T-Bank's current T-Invest API terms of service.

Any editing of the code by anyone other than the author, or a Claude Code
session under the author's direct control, is prohibited while the
repository is private.


