DISCLAIMER
----------

This is a personal, unofficial project, not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or associated with T-Bank / T-Investments in any way. It automates real
trading actions on real brokerage accounts. The author accepts no
responsibility or liability whatsoever for any financial loss, account
